  (label "+3V3A" (at 160 117.54 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "11647c66-3a40-509c-96e7-43aec1d23019"))
  (text "MCU: STM32G0B1KBU6 (UFQFPN-32, the GP pinout). Pin use (DS13560 rev 4, tables 12-16):\nPA11 (22) FDCAN1_RX AF3, PA12 (23) FDCAN1_TX AF3 (SYSCFG remap off).  PB6 (30) I2C1_SCL AF6, PB7 (31) I2C1_SDA AF6: the tuner.\nPB0 (15) tuner RST (output; pulled low, so the tuner stays in reset until the firmware starts).  PB1 (16) tuner INT (GPO2, input).\nPB2 (17) RET buffer enable, ACTIVE LOW (74LVC1G125 OE; 10k pull-up keeps it off at reset and while the MCU is blank).\nPA9 (19) USART1_TX AF1, PA10 (21) USART1_RX AF1: debug (J4, also the ROM bootloader).  PA0 (7) ADC1_IN0: slot ID.  PA5 (12) LED tuned, PA6 (13) LED stereo / RDS.\nPC14 / PC15 (2 / 3): 8 MHz HSE.  PA13 SWDIO, PA14 SWCLK (BOOT0 shares it), PF2 = NRST." (at 170 30 0) (effects (font (size 1.4 1.4)) (justify left top)) (uuid "d84f77e4-49b9-58d4-9fbb-3d4bdeb7891b"))
  (symbol (lib_id "RadioCard:STM32G0B1KBU6") (at 210 120 0) (unit 1) (in_bom yes) (on_board yes) (dnp no) (uuid "e2c74d67-33d8-5e10-a818-c40628f1ac86")
    (property "Reference" "U1" (at 187.14 93.33 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left)))
