  (text "Digital audio network (datasheet optional parts, AN383 tables 6-7): R1 604 on DOUT, R2 / R3 2k on DFS / DCLK, C9 2.2 pF C0G on the DFS line. I2S mode, slave: DCLK = rail BCK (64 fS), DFS = rail WS. Left channel when DFS is low." (at 300 105 0) (effects (font (size 1.4 1.4)) (justify left top)) (uuid "b7f4ad07-99f0-5534-98d8-a850b153ce21"))
