  (text "CONTROL (2-wire I2C): SCLK high at the rising edge of RST selects 2-wire; GPO1 high / GPO2 low at that edge (internal pull-up / pull-down). SEN sets the address (JP1: 1-2 bridged = SEN low = 0x11; 2-3 = 0x63, AN332 6.1). RST has 100k to GND so the tuner waits for the firmware." (at 300 180 0) (effects (font (size 1.4 1.4)) (justify left top)) (uuid "0d78e2c0-80f9-5343-9939-9619874be3d8"))
