  (text "REFERENCE CLOCK: the tuner takes it from DCLK (the rail BCK, 3.072 MHz at 48 kHz): REFCLK_PRESCALE = 0x1060 (bit 12 RCLKSEL = DCLK, prescale 96), REFCLK_FREQ = 32000 (AN332 properties 0x0201 / 0x0202, p.37-38). So the tuner runs on the audio card's sample clock: no drift between them, and no oscillator. Its own crystal cannot be used (GPO3 is DCLK). Fallback, unfitted: R to RCLK from the rail MCLK (12.288 MHz, prescale 375 = 32768 Hz), whose 8th harmonic is 98.3 MHz." (at 15 295 0) (effects (font (size 1.4 1.4)) (justify left top)) (uuid "946d36b1-8dde-5add-9e92-5826d4436b5a"))
  (symbol (lib_id "Device:R") (at 60 320 0) (unit 1) (in_bom yes) (on_board yes) (dnp yes) (uuid "5663ec5d-a36b-5338-9552-d4a4a9c3bf20")
