  (text "RAIL (RET, pin 18): audio to the audio card. 74LVC1G125, OFF at power-up (OE pulled high; the MCU pulls it low only after a NET RAIL grant, and releases it within 10 ms of a withdrawal), 33 R in series at the pin." (at 130 295 0) (effects (font (size 1.4 1.4)) (justify left top)) (uuid "d9a506ef-220b-5ef3-ad9b-5f51fb3f1fe3"))
