  (text "ANTENNA: J2 SMA edge mount on the top edge. FM (AN383 section 7, fig. 23): the whip node has L1 56 nH to RFGND (matches a ~22 pF whip; tune on the bench for the car whip and its cable, or leave it off), then C2 1 nF C0G to FMI. ESD: D2 under 1 pF on the SMA centre (AN383 asks for <= 1 pF; FMI / AMI absolute max 0.4 Vpk). AM: the datasheet circuit, a ferrite loopstick (180-450 uH) on J5 between the AM node and ground, 0.47 uF to AMI. JP2 (open) would feed the SMA to AM too: AN383 has no network for a car whip on AM (its section 10 SW whip network is the starting point). Keep AM stray capacitance under 10 pF." (at 235 275 0) (effects (font (size 1.4 1.4)) (justify left top)) (uuid "e8525fe3-764f-5df7-a901-5319b8a7cf68"))
